The '''Season of Jerry''' is a Winter Solstice event in Hypixel SkyBlock, taking place on Day 24 of Late Winter every year.

The main event in the Season of Jerry is the [[Defend Jerry's Workshop]] event that lasts {{Green|5}} rounds, and in between each round there's a timer of {{Green|8}} minutes in total. At the end of each round there will be presents depending on the amount of damage done.

== Accessing Jerry's Workshop ==
While the main event is only available for {{Green|1}} hour, {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}} can be accessed during the whole "Late Winter" season, which is around {{Green|8}} hours before the event and {{Green|1}} hour after. It can be accessed in the following ways:
* Clicking on {{NPCSprite|Jerry}} on the {{Zone|Private Island}}
* Using the [[SkyBlock Menu]], an icon will appear above the [[Fast Travel]] button
* Clicking on {{NPCSprite|Jerry}} in the {{Zone|Village}}
* Using commands {{Code|/savethejerrys}}, {{Code|/warp jerry}}, {{Code|/warp workshop}} or {{Code|/warp winter}}

== Defend Jerry's Workshop ==
{{Main|Defend Jerry's Workshop}}
While many different activities can be done during the '''Season of Jerry''', the main event itself that is available for only {{Green|1}} hour during the Late Winter season is defending Jerry's Workshop. 

This requires fighting various lava-based enemies, with Magma Cubes being the biggest threat that destroys rewards. These magma cubes can only be damaged with snowballs, making it so that every player has a fair chance at winning the event.

== Trivia ==
* The [[Season of Jerry]] was the third [[Event]] introduced to [[Hypixel]] [[SkyBlock]].
*During [[Dante|Dante's]] term as [[Mayor Election|Mayor]], this [[Events|Event]], alongside the [[Spooky Festival]] and [[Traveling Zoo]] were canceled.
*The [[Season of Jerry]] is a great way to earn money, as the amount of [[Gift|gifts]] received at the end of each round can be sold to the [[Bazaar]].

